# Compose, Design System & Navigation

**UI language:** Turkish copy for users; **no hardcoded user-visible strings** — use Compose Multiplatform resources (`composeResources`/string tables).

**Composable API:** Public composables take `modifier: Modifier = Modifier` as **last** parameter; single responsibility; **@Preview** where applicable.

**Design tokens (implement in theme package, single source of truth):**

- **Colors:** Primary `#00D4AA`, PrimaryDark `#00A884`, PrimaryLight `#5FFFD4`; Background `#0D0D0D`, Surface `#1A1A1A`, SurfaceVariant `#242424`; OnBackground `#F5F5F5`, OnSurface `#E0E0E0`, OnSurfaceMuted `#9E9E9E`; Accent `#FF6B35`, AccentSecondary `#7B61FF`; Success/Warning/Error as in spec; gradients Primary, Energy, Dark.
- **Type:** Montserrat (headings), Inter (body), JetBrains Mono (metrics) — scales: DisplayLarge/Medium, HeadlineLarge, BodyLarge/Medium, LabelSmall.
- **Spacing:** xs 4, sm 8, md 16, lg 24, xl 32, xxl 48 dp.
- **Shapes:** card 16dp, button 12dp, chip pill, bottom sheet top 24dp.

**Shared components (under `ui/components/`):** buttons, cards, text fields, progress, badges, bottom sheet, chips, avatar, loading/skeleton, gradient background, macro ring, workout/meal cards, charts — reuse before adding one-offs.

**Navigation:** Compose Navigation **3**, **type-safe** routes: each destination = `@Serializable` `data class` or `object`. Bottom bar only for the **five** main tabs. After onboarding, **clear back stack** to root graph as specified.

**Flows (reference):** Onboarding: `Splash → Welcome → Onboarding (4 steps) → Auth`. Main app: **Home**; **Workout** (daily plan, exercise detail, active session); **Nutrition** (diet plan, meal log photo/manual, macros); **Progress** (photo check-in, measurements, charts); **AI Coach** (chat); **Profile** (user, goals, settings/notifications).

**Motion:** 200–400ms; prefer spring for natural feel; screen enter fade + slight slide; staggered cards; counter/progress tweens; avoid distracting motion. Match product moments: completion pulse/confetti once, AI loading typing indicator, image skeletons, success check + haptic.
